      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794700000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "One sentence rarely holds the whole\nproblem, so write a few. Then the four\nquestions choose for you, so a shiny idea\ncan't pull you along.",
      "originalText": "One sentence rarely holds the whole\nproblem, so write a few. Then the four\nquestions choose for you, so a shiny idea\ncan't pull you along.",
